{%- doc -%}
  The six moments, in grid order, in one place. Every list of moments in the theme (mega menu, phone menu, search chips,
  hero chips, empty cart, bundle, About) reads this snippet, so the set is changed here only.

  Occasion-based set (owner decision 2026-10-30): Office, Evening out, Date night, Summer heat, Weddings & Eid, Winter nights.
  Each moment is a manual collection whose handle is "<key>-moment"; the key picks the mark, the colour tokens
  (--moment-<key>-*) and the label (locale key moments.<key>). Product cards derive the key from the handle the same way.

  Outputs a comma-separated list, to be captured and split:
    {% capture handles %}{% render 'moments-config', part: 'handles' %}{% endcapture %}
    {% assign handles = handles | strip | split: ',' %}

  @param {string} part - handles, keys (mark and tone names) or labels (locale keys).

  @example
  {% render 'moments-config', part: 'keys' %}
{%- enddoc -%}

{%- liquid
  case part
    when 'handles'
      echo 'daily-moment,night-moment,love-moment,fresh-moment,occasions-moment,winter-moment'
    when 'keys'
      echo 'daily,night,love,fresh,occasions,winter'
    when 'labels'
      echo 'moments.daily,moments.night,moments.love,moments.fresh,moments.occasions,moments.winter'
  endcase
-%}
